### 1. Register a new Citizen User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "name": "John Doe"
}

###

### 2. Login as the Citizen (Returns JWT Token)
# After running this, copy the "token" from the response!
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210"
}

###

### 3. Get User Profile
# Replace "YOUR_TOKEN_HERE" with the token you got from the login response!
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 4. Update User Profile
# Replace "YOUR_TOKEN_HERE" with the token you got from the login response!
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "John Doe (Updated)"
}
